{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, chord <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is drawn with length equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> (units). From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, a perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> meets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> a perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a762ac8b4e23ffdd778ad6d5a8b97df8c7ce01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> meets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a762ac8b4e23ffdd778ad6d5a8b97df8c7ce01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. In terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d072f6f3863376434aa84737b0c8a31f3926bece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MDA$\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, in appropriate square units, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/e/cbe0139288aaa7b0ff92d1523393f9118e0e5033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{3r^2}{16}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{\\pi r^2}{16}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{\\pi r^2\\sqrt{2}}{8}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{r^2\\sqrt{3}}{32}\\quad \\text{(E) } \\frac{r^2\\sqrt{6}}{48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"422\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01da117678388737b50047e2d57e193772efd6d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair O = (0,0); pair A = (-8.660,5); pair B = (-8.660,-5); pair M = (-8.660,0); pair D = (-8.660*0.75,5*0.75); draw(circle(O,10)); dot(O); label(&quot;$O$&quot;,O,E); dot(A); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,NW); dot(B); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); dot(M); label(&quot;$M$&quot;,M,SE); dot(D); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NE); draw(A--B--O--A); draw(O--M); draw(M--D); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"245\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd4d464255c46e5ba216ee5714c72caa16120dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AO = OB = AB$\" width=\"133\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e44c01c0ed926b86414a0fbedc2fe1d2eaa9b871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AOB$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equilateral_triangle\" title=\"Equilateral triangle\">equilateral triangle</a>, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de3a18339f50cda903ed49633483ea439fe52b27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OAB = 60^\\circ$\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />.  Using 30-60-90 triangles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/0/c50fe197f9defdd7261c07dded7028bbef54d1a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM = \\tfrac{r}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b8901da5d1fc57c07313277671339a91fd935f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = \\tfrac{r}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b18b5b9e9f429d62ebe7e28f4120e22c12abf11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DM = \\tfrac{r\\sqrt{3}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"86\" height=\"24\" />.  Thus, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/6/cc66b50ab33abd1f3da293e16c3d2359cc1b2243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADM$\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/120b324fa7056bce3270107912ac90d77a055d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{1}{2} \\cdot \\tfrac{r}{4} \\cdot \\tfrac{r\\sqrt{3}}{4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } \\tfrac{r^2 \\sqrt{3}}{32}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"181\" height=\"36\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=196